  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-27T07:11:39.570Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Even though I have locomotion animations off in 6-point tracking so I can slide around, the chest bone of my model is still animated, playing \"walking\" animations, looking and feeling really weird, especially when walking diagonally. Present with all of my avatars and public ones as well. All avatars use the default SDK animations.\nBeen there since the first IK2.0 beta, noticed by both me and friends and noticed it with everyone in general, I thought it would be fixed before release because it's such a visible issue, so I wonder if it's only limited people with this problem.",
